1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,067
How much of what you buy was

2
00:00:02,067 --> 00:00:03,200
not on your list?

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,020
One study says sixty-eight percent.

4
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:08,292
Another says eighteen.

5
00:00:09,042 --> 00:00:11,226
The first one counted items.

6
00:00:11,526 --> 00:00:13,710
The second counted categories.

7
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:16,654
Different yardsticks, different answers.

8
00:00:19,042 --> 00:00:20,914
Both numbers are real.

9
00:00:21,214 --> 00:00:22,887
Neither one tells you what

10
00:00:22,887 --> 00:00:24,046
is in your basket.

11
00:00:24,446 --> 00:00:26,520
So how much of what ZERO buys

12
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,950
was not on his list?
